# DO nancy-drew.configure-ini --into=<the game's folder>
#
# What every .ini file in a Nancy Drew game's folder has changed once it's
# installed (ini.yaml: LCD mode, saves in Documents), as
# WrappBuildHelper.configureGameINI does today. Run after every final stage
# that uses the module (its `assemble`), with the bundle's install folder.
FUNCTION configure-ini
  ARG into
  EDIT "${into}/*.ini" --from-data=ini
END
